tic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014500/extras/6cbfd71ebbae866fb4e6faf3fb64ec99.avif?t=1755119069\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br>Use your magic wand to cast powerful spells varying from lingering area-of-effect zones to controllable projectiles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014500/extras/049045ed4c397be875494be79820cd9f.poster.avif?t=1755119069\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014500/extras/049045ed4c397be875494be79820cd9f.webm?t=1755119069\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3014500/extras/049045ed4c397be875494be79820cd9f.mp4?t=1755119069\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
